<title>CANADA: Canada daily lumber export figures to U.S..</title>
<headline>Canada daily lumber export figures to U.S..</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada softwood lumber exports to the United States as of 0001 EST on March 17 in board feet, according to data from the Canadian Department of Foreign Affairs and International Trade:</p>
<p>		   For the Jan 1 - March 31 quarter:</p>
<p>Province   BC	 Alberta     Ontario    Quebec     Total</p>
<p>bonus    13.33 mln  10.36 mln   9.50 mln  45.40 mln  78.59 mln</p>
<p>EB	  1.34 bln 161.31 mln 219.69 mln 410.68 mln   2.13 bln</p>
<p>LFB	89.96 mln  11.64 mln  24.18 mln  46.03 mln 171.81 mln</p>
<p>UFB	53.29 mln   8.53 mln  40.25 mln  91.64 mln 193.71 mln</p>
<p>Pct exported: EB - 14.51, LFB - 26.43</p>
</text>
